        "title": "Pull out negative",
        "text": "Pull out the negative sign to write as having a common denominator. \\n $$\\frac{3}{x-2}+\\frac{5}{2-x}=\\frac{3}{x-2}+\\frac{5}{\\left(-x-2\\right)}$$",
